# GET /api/v1/openOrders — manual smoke checks for the account-scoped open-orders read
# Compatibility: VS Code REST Client, JetBrains HTTP Client
#
# Response shape: { orders: [...], nextCursor: string | null }.
# Each order: marketAddress, symbol, orderId, clientOrderId, price, origQty,
# executedQty, status (NEW | PARTIALLY_FILLED), timeInForce (GTC), type (LIMIT),
# side (BUY | SELL), time (unix ms), updateTime (unix ms).
#
# Auth: USER_DATA scope. Each request needs `X-DODEX-APIKEY`, `timestamp`,
# `recvWindow` (optional), and `signature`. Signing rules live in
# docs/api-spec.md §Signature Formation. Short version:
#
#     canonicalQueryString = <all query params except `signature`, sorted by key>
#     signature            = HMAC_SHA256(canonicalQueryString, apiSecret) → hex
#
# The default values below use the seed credentials from
# crates/infrastructure/src/seed.rs (loaded by the dev DB seed) — these only
# work against a server pointed at a seeded DB. For each request, regenerate
# `{{timestamp}}` and `{{signature}}` before sending; example for the
# no-filter request:
#
#     ts=$(date +%s%3N)
#     msg="recvWindow=5000&timestamp=$ts"
#     sig=$(printf '%s' "$msg" | openssl dgst -sha256 -mac HMAC \
#             -macopt hexkey:1de6fc5cf8899e7f1dacf449fe46c3c88854478b7fcd9dd26c664535ee589966 \
#             | awk '{print $2}')
#     echo "$ts $sig"

@host = http://localhost:8080
@apiKey = dk_live_test_001
@apiSecret = 1de6fc5cf8899e7f1dacf449fe46c3c88854478b7fcd9dd26c664535ee589966
@marketAddress = 0:b286c2c1996fe90fe5ed06679115f8b9be4b3184accfb84ac22308cad5d81a48
@symbol = PM-2026-ELECTION-YES
@recvWindow = 5000
# Fill these per-request — see the openssl one-liner above.
@timestamp = 1710000000000
@signature = <hex-hmac-of-canonicalQueryString>

### no filter — all open orders for the authenticated account
GET {{host}}/api/v1/openOrders?recvWindow={{recvWindow}}&timestamp={{timestamp}}&signature={{signature}}
X-DODEX-APIKEY: {{apiKey}}
Accept: application/json

### explicit limit (default 100, max 500)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/openOrders?limit=10&recvWindow={{recvWindow}}&timestamp={{timestamp}}&signature={{signature}}
X-DODEX-APIKEY: {{apiKey}}
Accept: application/json

### filtered by (marketAddress, symbol) → one-market view
GET {{host}}/api/v1/openOrders?marketAddress={{marketAddress}}&recvWindow={{recvWindow}}&symbol={{symbol}}&timestamp={{timestamp}}&signature={{signature}}
X-DODEX-APIKEY: {{apiKey}}
Accept: application/json

### pagination — first page (copy `nextCursor` from the response into the next request)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/openOrders?limit=2&recvWindow={{recvWindow}}&timestamp={{timestamp}}&signature={{signature}}
X-DODEX-APIKEY: {{apiKey}}
Accept: application/json

### pagination — second page (replace `<cursor>` with `nextCursor` from above and re-sign)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/openOrders?cursor=<cursor>&limit=2&recvWindow={{recvWindow}}&timestamp={{timestamp}}&signature={{signature}}
X-DODEX-APIKEY: {{apiKey}}
Accept: application/json

### one-sided filter (marketAddress without symbol) → -1102 / 400
GET {{host}}/api/v1/openOrders?marketAddress={{marketAddress}}&recvWindow={{recvWindow}}&timestamp={{timestamp}}&signature={{signature}}
X-DODEX-APIKEY: {{apiKey}}
Accept: application/json

### one-sided filter (symbol without marketAddress) → -1102 / 400
GET {{host}}/api/v1/openOrders?recvWindow={{recvWindow}}&symbol={{symbol}}&timestamp={{timestamp}}&signature={{signature}}
X-DODEX-APIKEY: {{apiKey}}
Accept: application/json

### unknown (marketAddress, symbol) pair → -1121 / 404
GET {{host}}/api/v1/openOrders?marketAddress=0:does-not-exist&recvWindow={{recvWindow}}&symbol=PM-DOES-NOT-EXIST&timestamp={{timestamp}}&signature={{signature}}
X-DODEX-APIKEY: {{apiKey}}
Accept: application/json

### limit out of range (above 500) → -1102 / 400
GET {{host}}/api/v1/openOrders?limit=501&recvWindow={{recvWindow}}&timestamp={{timestamp}}&signature={{signature}}
X-DODEX-APIKEY: {{apiKey}}
Accept: application/json

### limit zero → -1102 / 400
GET {{host}}/api/v1/openOrders?limit=0&recvWindow={{recvWindow}}&timestamp={{timestamp}}&signature={{signature}}
X-DODEX-APIKEY: {{apiKey}}
Accept: application/json

### unparseable limit → -1102 / 400
GET {{host}}/api/v1/openOrders?limit=abc&recvWindow={{recvWindow}}&timestamp={{timestamp}}&signature={{signature}}
X-DODEX-APIKEY: {{apiKey}}
Accept: application/json

### malformed cursor → -1102 / 400
GET {{host}}/api/v1/openOrders?cursor=not-a-valid-cursor&recvWindow={{recvWindow}}&timestamp={{timestamp}}&signature={{signature}}
X-DODEX-APIKEY: {{apiKey}}
Accept: application/json

### empty cursor → -1102 / 400 (not silently treated as "no cursor")
GET {{host}}/api/v1/openOrders?cursor=&recvWindow={{recvWindow}}&timestamp={{timestamp}}&signature={{signature}}
X-DODEX-APIKEY: {{apiKey}}
Accept: application/json

### missing X-DODEX-APIKEY header → -1003 / 401
GET {{host}}/api/v1/openOrders?recvWindow={{recvWindow}}&timestamp={{timestamp}}&signature={{signature}}
Accept: application/json

### missing signature → -1003 / 401
GET {{host}}/api/v1/openOrders?recvWindow={{recvWindow}}&timestamp={{timestamp}}
X-DODEX-APIKEY: {{apiKey}}
Accept: application/json

### unknown API key → -1002 / 401
GET {{host}}/api/v1/openOrders?recvWindow={{recvWindow}}&timestamp={{timestamp}}&signature={{signature}}
X-DODEX-APIKEY: dk_not_a_real_key
Accept: application/json
